# Spring API

- Runtime AI inference via Spring AI only — not Python
- Layering: web → service → repository → domain
- Maven build (`pom.xml`); run with `.\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run` (Windows) or `./mvnw spring-boot:run`
- Flyway for schema; JSONB for card_details.content
- AI DTOs in `AiContracts` nested records
